<div id="A1.I2.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The average patch length is 5.8 for words, 5.0 for BPEs, and 3.7 for silence spans.</p>
</div></li>
